rt 4/5. Contains the arcs Mayoi Hell, Hitagi Rendezvous, and Ougi Dark from the Owarimonogatari light novels.\n\nKoyomi wakes up to see Mayoi Hachikuji before him, the girl who supposedly had gone to the afterlife. She tells Koyomi that they are currently in Avichi, the lowest levels of hell. Koyomi is dubious of how Mayoi knew about the exact timing of his death and which hell he would drop into, when Mayoi tells him that she was there to pick him up by the request of a certain individual.\n\n(Source: Aniplex)"},"tags":[{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":78,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":52,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Astronomy","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":41,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":41,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Owarimonogatari Second Season","english":"Owarimonogatari Second Season","native":"終物語（下）","romaji":"Owarimonogatari (Ge)","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"终物语（下）"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Owarimonogatari (2017)"}]},"trailer":{"id":"7WdyIcDlK2o","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7WdyIcDlK2o/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}